From 43c27d350a718a832e6c99ef15b9f61b2af7f06e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:58:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD terminal visual selection yanks for both panes

Terminal users need a modal way to copy rendered chat and agent-list text without leaving Work Leaf. Command mode now starts character, line, or block selections from the focused pane, moves the selection with Vim-style keys or arrows, and yanks the selected text through the terminal clipboard so both left-pane rows and right-pane transcript content use the same rendering path.
